Added `RequestPerformanceMeasurementsMiddleware` to measure and report request performance measurements as a `Server-Timing` header in HTTP responses.
Added `REQUEST_TOTAL_DURATION_HEADER_ENABLED` settings variable, which when set to true enables a "total request duration" performance measurement on each request/response.
Added `REQUEST_DB_DURATION_HEADER_ENABLED` settings variable, which when set to true enables a "database query duration" performance measurement on each request/response.
